  "plat.suggestedFields": { ar:"الحقول المقترحة: {fields}. لا تضع API keys أو passwords هنا؛ استخدم Secret Manager/environment references.", en:"Suggested fields: {fields}. Do not put API keys or passwords here; use Secret Manager/environment references.", tr:"Önerilen alanlar: {fields}. API keys veya passwords buraya koymayın; Secret Manager/environment references kullanın.", zh:"建议字段：{fields}。请勿在此放置 API keys 或 passwords；请使用 Secret Manager/environment references。", hi:"सुझाए गए फ़ील्ड: {fields}। यहाँ API keys या passwords न डालें; Secret Manager/environment references का उपयोग करें।", es:"Campos sugeridos: {fields}. No pongas API keys ni passwords aquí; usa Secret Manager/environment references.", fr:"Champs suggérés : {fields}. Ne mettez pas d'API keys ou de passwords ici ; utilisez Secret Manager/environment references.", ur:"تجویز کردہ فیلڈز: {fields}۔ یہاں API keys یا passwords نہ رکھیں؛ Secret Manager/environment references استعمال کریں۔" },
